@startuml
title Admin Recommender Retrain Activity Diagram
skinparam swimlaneBorderColor black
skinparam swimlaneTitleBackgroundColor #EEE
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam activityArrowColor #333
skinparam activityBorderColor #333
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 50

|Admin_User|
|System| 
|External_API| (Python Recommender Service)

|Admin_User|
start
:Access Retrain/Recs Page;
|System|
:Fetch User List (for dropdown);
:Render Retrain View;
|Admin_User|
:Select User ID & Click "Get Recs";
|System|
:Send Request to Python Service;
|External_API|
:Calculate Recommendations 
(Collaborative + Content-Based);
:Return List of Song IDs;
|System|
:Receive JSON Response;
:Match IDs with Song Database;
:Render Recommendations List;
|Admin_User|
:View Recommended Songs (Debug);
stop
@enduml
